  "body": "### Summary\nLOT-032 (#59, PR #262) needs a captured page with this state to test quote analysis on real HTML. Hand-built snippets cannot stand in for it (LESSONS 36).\n\nState: a quote header link whose URL fragment is not #t<digits> (e.g. an old-format or external link).\n\nSource: docs/lots/LOT-032-quote-analysis.md, pending capture.\n\nAcceptance criteria\n- A real page with this state, anonymized, in captures/ with a MANIFEST row.\n- The legacy oracle run on it, if it is a topic page.\n- A test in LOT-032's suite reads it.",
